{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And he told.</b> The verse says 'he told Jacob' but does not specify who; and many verses are brief of expression." "<b>And Israel strengthened himself.</b> He said: Even though he is my son, he is a king — I will accord him honor. From here that one accords honor to royalty. And so Moses accorded honor to royalty — ״וְיָרְדוּ כָל עֲבָדֶיךָ אֵלֶּה אֵלַי״ (Exodus 11); and so Elijah — ״וַיְשַׁנֵּס מָתְנָיו״ (I Kings 18)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:53.759548495Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}